---
source: crates/instrukt-cli/tests/cases/harness.rs
expression: help
---
Adopt instrukt in the current git repository

Usage: instrukt init [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --slug <SLUG>                  The project slug, instead of the one derived from the primary
                                     worktree's folder name
      --company <KEY>                Add the company of this key to the computer instead: its
                                     repository `company-<key>` in the organisation `github.org`
                                     names, created with the company skeleton when it does not
                                     exist, checked out as ~/.instrukt/companies/<key>/ and made
                                     ready. The working directory is not read
      --name <NAME>                  The name people write the company by; needed only when its
                                     repository is created
      --admin <LOGIN>                The company's GitHub administrator, a person's GitHub account;
                                     needed only when its repository is created
      --human-involved <true|false>  Whether a human was involved, declared for the root commit of a
                                     created repository; `false` when omitted [possible values:
                                     true, false]
  -h, --help                         Print help
  -V, --version                      Print version
